# What `docker build` may see of this folder. The Dockerfile copies
# only what it needs, but Docker sends it everything not listed here.
# So: nothing at all, then only what the image is built from, then
# never secrets or state, even inside those folders.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!gui
!LICENSE
**/seats.env*
**/.env
**/*.key
**/office.db*
**/.git
**/__pycache__
